---
description: Apply responsive, maintainable Tailwind conventions to HTML and Vue templates.
globs: *.html,*.vue
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep template markup semantic and accessible.
- Design every layout for narrow and wide viewports; use responsive variants such as `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, and `xl:` deliberately.
- Reuse the project's existing component and utility patterns. Keep class lists readable and avoid unrelated visual changes.
